        {
          "text": "Mbuboobu mbwaamba Jehova wamakamu. Kuyooba limbi banene abacembele bakala mumigwagwa ya-Jerusalemu, umwi aumwi uyoojata mufunko mujanza lyakwe nkaambo kakucembaala. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
