        },
        {
          "text": "Mbuboobu mbwaamba Jehova wamakamu. Amuyumye maanza aanu, inywe nomumvwide ano mazuba majwi aya aazwa mumulomo wabasinsimi, kuzwa kubuzuba intalisyo yaŋanda ya-Jehova wamakamu niyakatalika kubikwa, intempele niyakatalika kuyakwa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ZEC.8.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
