          "text": "Lino mbuli mbumwakaba cisampauzyo akati kabamasi, luzubo lwa-Juda aluzubo lwa-Israyeli, lino njoomufutula kuti mube cilongezyo, Mutayoowi pe. Amuyumye maanza aanu.",
