        {
          "text": "Mutayeeyi bubi umwi aumwi kumweenzinyina mumyoyo yanu, alimwi mutayandi zikonkezyo zyakubeja. Nkaambo nzezintu ezi nzensulide, mbwaamba Jehova.",
