        {
          "text": "Mbuboobu mbwaamba Jehova wamakamu. Kuliimya kwamwezi wane, akuliimya kwamwezi wasanu, akuliimya kwamwezi wamusanu aibili, akuliimya kwamwezi wakumi, zyoonse ziyoobeda luzubo lwa-Juda ziindi zyakukondwa akusekelela amapobwe mabotu. Lino amuyandisye buswini aluumuno.",
          "type": "text",
