          "text": "Mbuboobu mbwaamba Jehova wamakamu. Mumazuba ayo bantu bali ikumi bazwa kumisyobo yoonse akumyaambo yoonse bayoojata cikobela camuntu mu-Juda, bayooti, Atweende anywebo, nkaambo twamvwa kuti Leza mpali akati kanu.",
